[{:db/id "q-109582/selection/2550fb3826d2c0fe7172f7671302b0fd057c6c4d91f52f74be3fd70379b1f1f5" :answer/id #uuid "85209c38-b0dd-5e37-be15-626b1d4fab54" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10{x}_{1}-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582/selection/1254ab48b7a027c5d47e9a469c642dc4bf45c3e5c6891ab4d06f95d9ef882d38" :answer/id #uuid "6e0ad053-cf7a-570c-9197-f6484c8e1947" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-10{x}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582/selection/464b2fa540c9719bf063b92cec4100de58d60714bf3ab07c39cdc522e1302cd1" :answer/id #uuid "bd27a512-79b2-5a25-b37f-3b18aa046949" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}+10{x}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582/selection/efb62174ed3f35e81a3c779fd4f76e6c24623de2107bce061a48a767718c7872" :answer/id #uuid "1f66bee2-8cc5-554d-bb48-2a7ea4665e7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-10{x}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582/selection/c290849aa6d536e03ae880bbd1f2b8ab4542f289f698b50a70b3818f9a71817c" :answer/id #uuid "0fe48242-a69c-535f-8804-bf70c7ecfa52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10{x}_{1}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "56d954e1-cf8b-53a7-894c-8d1f243cfe90" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109582/selection/c290849aa6d536e03ae880bbd1f2b8ab4542f289f698b50a70b3818f9a71817c" :answer-field/choices ["q-109582/selection/2550fb3826d2c0fe7172f7671302b0fd057c6c4d91f52f74be3fd70379b1f1f5" "q-109582/selection/1254ab48b7a027c5d47e9a469c642dc4bf45c3e5c6891ab4d06f95d9ef882d38" "q-109582/selection/464b2fa540c9719bf063b92cec4100de58d60714bf3ab07c39cdc522e1302cd1" "q-109582/selection/efb62174ed3f35e81a3c779fd4f76e6c24623de2107bce061a48a767718c7872" "q-109582/selection/c290849aa6d536e03ae880bbd1f2b8ab4542f289f698b50a70b3818f9a71817c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109582" :question/id #uuid "95129f08-fcca-5b68-9041-afb0f8ffaa61" :question/math-academy-id "q-109582" :question/problem "The second-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{y}^{′}-10y=0\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =y \\\\ {x}_{2} & ={y}^{′}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′} & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{″}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{y}^{′}+10y.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}+10{x}_{1}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=10{x}_{1}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $f(t)=10{x}_{1}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-109582/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82820104-bd75-549b-